  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core Sparkline Charts control renders compact, lightweight inline charts designed to be embedded within table cells, dashboards, and text content for showing trends without taking up much space. It supports Line, Area, Column, WinLoss, and Pie sparkline types with features like markers, tooltips, data labels, range bands, and special point highlighting (high, low, first, last, negative). Ideal for KPI grids, financial reports, and data tables in ASP.NET Core applications.",
